% Stress model lookup for abc2midi -BF when the R: field or the meter is
% spelled differently from the built-in table in stresspat.c.  Each tune
% must find a model, so that abc2midi -BF 2 -Werror exits 0.
% Tune 1: M:2/2 is the same meter as M:C|, and the table has Reel C|.
% Tune 2: R:Slipjig is spelled Slip Jig in the table.
% Tune 3: Tango 2/4 is the last table entry, which the lookup used to miss
% because the number of models was off by one.
X:1
T:Reel in 2/2
C:abc2midi test
R:Reel
M:2/2
L:1/8
K:D
FAAB AFED|FAAB A2de|fedB AFEF|D2FD E2DE|

X:2
T:Slipjig spelled as one word
C:abc2midi test
R:Slipjig
M:9/8
L:1/8
K:G
GBd gdB c2A|GBd gdB A2B|

X:3
T:Tango
C:abc2midi test
R:Tango
M:2/4
L:1/8
K:Am
A>A EA|c>B AE|
